#: ../../guide/converts.md:1
#: a04314237f934bbb820aa5dfde4b462a
msgid "Converts in depth"
msgstr "Konvertéierungen am Detail"

#: ../../guide/converts.md:3
#: 51f1cd8fc9a042cc9606018c10eb1c62
msgid "An osu! beatmap can be played in another ruleset. parsecore reproduces each conversion exactly like osu!, so converted star ratings and pp match the game."
msgstr "Eng osu!-Beatmap kann an engem anere Ruleset gespillt ginn. parsecore reproduzéiert all Konvertéierung genee wéi osu!, sou datt déi konvertéiert Star-Ratings an d'pp-Wäerter mam Spill iwwereneestëmmen."

#: ../../guide/converts.md:6
#: 4419c5bacf6a4b1d8b542b071a164f04
msgid "osu! → taiko"
msgstr "osu! → taiko"

#: ../../guide/converts.md:8
#: 3b3fa77a20b7482d92f31d76e5003f4c
msgid "Circles become don/kat notes (decided by hit sound), and sliders are either kept as drum rolls or split into a run of hit circles following osu!-stable's tick-spacing and velocity rules. Scroll-speed effect points are inserted so the new **Reading** skill sees the right velocities."
msgstr "Circles ginn zu Don-/Kat-Noten, jee no Hitsound. Slider ginn entweder als Trommelwirbele bäibehalen oder an eng Rei vun Hit-Circles opgedeelt, dobäi ginn d'Reegele vun osu!stable fir den Tick-Ofstand an d'Geschwindegkeet befollegt. Scroll-Speed-Effektpunkte ginn agefüügt, sou datt den neie **Reading**-Skill déi richteg Geschwindegkeeten erfaasst."

#: ../../guide/converts.md:13
#: 65380149ce3c4066a1002acfe5e40e43
msgid "osu! → catch"
msgstr "osu! → catch"

#: ../../guide/converts.md:15
#: df221e6510c74edaa3d5735d57a6a75f
msgid "Objects become fruits, droplets and juice streams. Hyperdashes are detected, and the legacy RNG is consumed for droplet jitter and banana showers exactly as in the game."
msgstr "Objete ginn zu Friichten, Drëpsen a Juice-Streams. Hyperdashes ginn erkannt, an de Legacy-RNG gëtt fir d'Variatioun vun den Drëpsen an d'Bananneschauere genee wéi am Spill verbraucht."

#: ../../guide/converts.md:18
#: bbdbf9a429b84a2190d23fc2f884c79f
msgid "osu! → mania"
msgstr "osu! → mania"

#: ../../guide/converts.md:20
#: 1b014beddfe84c63b0e1fced591550e4
msgid "This is the most involved conversion: the full **legacy pattern generator** decides how many columns the map uses and places notes/hold notes using osu!stable's RNG. The generated pattern and therefore the star rating and pp is bit-identical to osu!."
msgstr "Dëst ass déi komplexst Konvertéierung: De komplette **Legacy-Pattern-Generator** bestëmmt, wéi vill Kolonnen d'Map benotzt, a plazéiert Noten an Hold-Notte mam RNG vun osu!stable. Dat generéiert Pattern an domat och de Star-Rating an d'pp-Wäerter si Bit fir Bit identesch mat osu!."

#: ../../guide/converts.md:34
#: 6d2a69935e5642bfbab0caaa076e25cb
msgid "Native maps of each ruleset are, of course, calculated directly without conversion."
msgstr "Nativ Maps vun all Ruleset ginn natierlech direkt an ouni Konvertéierung berechent."

